 lives, waste resources, or condemn innocent people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112190/extras/2738b239dc2b984fa225695be1dd83f4.poster.avif?t=1781372581\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112190/extras/2738b239dc2b984fa225695be1dd83f4.webm?t=1781372581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112190/extras/2738b239dc2b984fa225695be1dd83f4.mp4?t=1781372581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112190/extras/848bd08564bb4c7fdb216b09b94c96f7.poster.avif?t=1781372581\" width=1170 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112190/extras/848bd08564bb4c7fdb216b09b94c96f7.webm?t=1781372581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112190/extras/848bd08564bb4c7fdb216b09b94c96f7.mp4?t=1781372581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a routine night shift slowly turns into psychological horror as systems fail, transmissions distort, and something begins to notice you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112190/extras/b9877cd3f6397a8d3dea658df511cd2a.poster.avif?t=1781372581\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112190/extras/b9877cd3f6397a8d3dea658df511cd2a.webm?t=17813725